---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// The RL loop with trading labels: the agent sends an order, the market answers with a new state and a reward.
const W = 900;
const H = 380;
---
<figure class="p19-loop">
  <div class="p19-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="The reinforcement learning loop. On the left, the agent (a model). On the right, the market. The agent sends an action, for example buy 100 shares. The market returns the next state, such as the last four days and the current position, and a reward, such as profit minus fees. The loop repeats every step.">
      <text x="30" y="28" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>One step of the loop, repeated every day</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Một vòng lặp, lặp lại mỗi ngày</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="40" y="90" width="250" height="200" rx="12" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="model" x={165} y={128} size={30} />
      <text x="165" y="176" text-anchor="middle" class="t">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Agent</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Agent</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="165" y="202" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
        <tspan data-lang-en>a policy: state in,</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>một policy: nhận state,</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="165" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
        <tspan data-lang-en>action out</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>trả ra hành động</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="165" y="256" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
        <tspan data-lang-en>learns from the rewards</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>học từ phần thưởng</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="610" y="90" width="250" height="200" rx="12" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={735} y={128} size={30} />
      <text x="735" y="176" text-anchor="middle" class="t">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Market</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thị trường</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="735" y="202" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
        <tspan data-lang-en>prices, order book,</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>giá, sổ lệnh,</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="735" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
        <tspan data-lang-en>fees, price band</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>phí, biên độ giá</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="735" y="256" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
        <tspan data-lang-en>does not care about you</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>không quan tâm tới bạn</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="290" y1="130" x2="602" y2="130" class="arrow fm-flow" />
      <polygon points="610,130 598,124 598,136" class="head" />
      <text x="450" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="t">
        <tspan data-lang-en>action</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>hành động</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="450" y="152" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
        <tspan data-lang-en>buy 100 shares / hold / sell</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>mua 100 cổ / giữ / bán</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="610" y1="236" x2="298" y2="236" class="arrow" />
      <polygon points="290,236 302,230 302,242" class="head" />
      <text x="450" y="218" text-anchor="middle" class="t">
        <tspan data-lang-en>next state + reward</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>state mới + phần thưởng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="450" y="258" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
        <tspan data-lang-en>last 4 days, position / profit − fees</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>4 ngày gần nhất, vị thế / lãi − phí</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="40" y="320" width="820" height="40" rx="8" class="note" />
      <text x="450" y="345" text-anchor="middle" class="s2">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Nobody labels the right action. The agent finds out later, through the sum of rewards.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không ai ghi nhãn hành động đúng. Agent biết sau, qua tổng phần thưởng.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The only feedback is a number. Whether that number measures what you care about is the whole difficulty of this post.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Phản hồi duy nhất là một con số. Con số đó có đo đúng thứ bạn quan tâm hay không là toàn bộ cái khó của bài này.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p19-loop { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p19-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p19-loop svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .p19-loop text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p19-loop .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-loop .t { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-loop .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p19-loop .s2 { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-loop .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .p19-loop .note { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1; }
  .p19-loop .arrow { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .p19-loop .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p19-loop figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
